  "details": "For anyone that speaks multiple languages (or just hates the default qwerty layout) the fact that the in-game keyboard has always had only a single layout is a huge bummer.\n\nAnd considering how many people speak different languages that don't use the standard alphabet (or people that don't use the qwerty layout) on the platform I believe its about time to get this implemented for anyone that needs it.\n\nSome layouts however use plenty of non-standard features (at least compared to the US qwerty layout) such as dead keys or a conversion system from latin to a non latin alphabet.\n\nHowever if accounted for, the addition of multiple layouts would be amazing for not just people who speak a different language than english (or any language using the latin alphabet) but also qwerty haters :D (not me i would never).\n\nThe image included below is a simple mockup of how a button to switch layouts would look like in the in-game keyboard (its very rushed so dw abt it too much)",
